\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak crown weakens a touch, focus shifts to SPP. \b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Februar 2002\par 10:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      BRATISLAVA, Feb 15 (Reuters) - The Slovak crown eased a \par \par \uc2  touch at the open on Friday, and dealers said they expected the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stay in a broad range over the near term until \par \par \uc2  political questions concerning a major privatisation are solved. \par \par \uc2      The crown was trading at 42.23/29 to its key reference \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the euro, at 0840 GMT, from 42.20/25 late on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  It was at 48.38/46 to the dollar, from 48.49/56. \par \par \uc2      The crown firmed by about half a percent on Thursday after \par \par \uc2  Deputy Premier for Economy Ivan Miklos, the Cabinet's key \par \par \uc2  reformer, survived an opposition-led no-confidence vote in \par \par \uc2  Parliament. \par \par \uc2      But dealers said unresolved questions over the sale of gas \par \par \uc2  monopoly SPP, which the coalition SDL party is trying to halt, \par \par \uc2  would mean that further rises would be limited. \par \par \uc2      "After this no-confidence vote we firmed really rapidly... \par \par \uc2  I would say that we should stay in a range of 42.1-42.4 for a \par \par \uc2  longer period," said Slovenska Sporitelna dealer Juraj Zabadal. \par \par \uc2      "The mood in middle-Europe is really good. Yesterday we saw \par \par \uc2  the Hungarian forint firming, so I think there will still be \par \par \uc2  room for the Slovak crown to firm, but the case of SPP is still \par \par \uc2  not resolved, so we will have to wait." \par \par \uc2  In a morning report, Volksbank recommended investors keep \par \par \uc2  long Slovak crown positions on expectations it will firm against \par \par \uc2  the euro ahead of the SPP sale, but it also warned of easing if \par \par \uc2  the Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (CNB) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  against that country's \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is trading at very high levels. \par \par \uc2      "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crown will likely face a threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  of the CNB against the strong CZK/EUR cross. Such an \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would lead to weakening of the SKK versus the \par \par \uc2  euro," Volksbank said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020215dy2f00i8e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
