y short euro market. \par \par \uc2  The Slovak unit has lost more than three percent since mid-November, when it traded at around 42.5 to the euro. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx1306w0q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
