\par\par \b \uc2  INTERVIEW-Slovak c.bank vicegov happy with  \highlight22\uc2 fx \highlight\uc2  rate. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Juraj Draxler \par \uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 September 2000\par 16:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Sept 20 (Reuters) - The Vice Governor of the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBS) Elena Kohutikova said on Wednesday that the NBS is satisfied with the exchange rate of the Slovak crown to the euro this year. \par \par \uc2   "In the first half of the year and now...I consider the \par \par \uc2   performance (of the crown) as very stable...any fluctuations \par \par \uc2   have been short-term...we do not have any indication that it \par \par \uc2  should be otherwise," Kohutikova told Reuters in an interview. \par \par \uc2  "The crown-dollar exchange rate is not that positive for us, but that is outside the influence of the NBS," Kohutikova said. \par \par \uc2  She stressed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if needed. \par \par \uc2  "We are watching the non-economic factors, and we are ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary." \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crown has been sliding since President Rudolf Schuster called a referendum on early elections two weeks ago following an opposition-initiated citizen petition. \par \par \uc2  Kohutikova said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not have strict targets for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We always evaluate the performance of the crown on the background of the economy." \par \par \uc2  Recently, the crown has been consistently shaking off macroeconomic data. \par \par \uc2  "Apart from non-economic influences...the crown is mostly sensitive to capital and financial account," Kohutikova said. \par \par \uc2  She said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ready to assuage any impact from privatisation proceeds on Slovak financial markets. \par \par \uc2  "The (state privatisation agency) National Property Fund (NPF) has an account at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and NPF is the recepient of the privatisation proceeds...so we can release the proceeds gradually." \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw9k076re\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
