\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank says  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  to halt crown fall. \b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Mai 2000\par 12:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, May 4 (Reuters) - The chief dealer at the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Vladimir Polhorsky, told Reuters the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday after the crown weakened sharply against the euro. \par \par \uc2  The Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened at 41.7 to the euro but rapidly declined as the morning session got underway, briefly hitting levels of around 42.45. \par \par \uc2  "Today's weakening was too extensive so we \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in favour of the crown to reduce volatility and calm down the market," Polhorsky said. He added the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in the form of direct calls to selected banks with whom trades were conducted. \par \par \uc2  He would not disclose the volume of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or the level at which it came but a dealer at a local bank who requested anonymity said he believed \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  began at about 42.2 to the euro and estimated the volume at around 30 million euros. It was quoted at 42.045/130 at 1053 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Polhorsky said that according to his sources at commercial banks, the weakening of the crown was driven by foreign institutions closing crown positions. The reason for the weakening was not clear but local media reported earlier in the day that two big privatisation projects would be delayed. ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax 421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw54017jk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
