\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank says no  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  at current rate. \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 10:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, March 7 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap crown strength at the current rate of around 41.61 to the euro. \par \par \uc2  "At these levels we are not entering into the market yet," Frantisek Szulenyi, the head of the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets department at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Szulenyi also said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  still had a secret level at which it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent a firming of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allowed the crown to firm through the 42.3 level - where it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on several occasions - and subsequently the 42.0 to the euro levels - which many dealers believed could have been the new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level - some analysts suggested that the bank may no longer have a firm idea of when it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again. \par \par \uc2  Specifically asked whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  still had a level at which the market should expect an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Szulenyi said: \par \par \uc2  "Of course, we have a certain internal level."In keeping with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  practice, he would not be drawn on what that level was. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Brigita Schmognerova said on Monday that the rate of the crown to the euro was "appropriate" at levels reached last Friday when the crown was trading at around 41.75 to the euro. \par \par \uc2  Szulenyi said he had no comment to make on the minister's remarks. \par \par \uc2  ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax 421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw37054qm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
