\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  crown steady near c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  level. \b0\par\par\uc2 194 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Februar 2000\par 09:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BRATISLAVA, Feb 14 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Slovak\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  crown\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par was calm in quiet Monday morning trading, hovering near the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  levels where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been repeatedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \par \par \uc2  prevent a firming, dealers said. \par \par \uc2      The crown was quoted at 42.30/32 to the euro at 0840 GMT, \par \par \uc2  unchanged from Friday's close. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has repeatedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  since \par \par \uc2  mid-December at around 42.3 to the euro to prevent the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  from strengthening. \par \par \uc2      "We have seen only very passive trading so far today," said \par \par \uc2  VUB Bank's Ladislav Benedek. "Should demand for crowns \par \par \uc2  strengthen the crown over 42.3 (to the euro), the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  is very likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again," he added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said economic fundamentals do not \par \par \uc2  warrant a crown firmer than 42.3 to the euro at present. But the \par \par \uc2  bank has said its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level could change at any time if \par \par \uc2  fundamentals change. \par \par \uc2  The crown was quoted at 42.78/83 to the dollar at 0840 GMT. \par \par \uc2  ((Andrej Salner, Bratislava Ne