\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  crown calm after cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  Wednesday. \b0\par\par\uc2 200 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Februar 2000\par 09:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BRATISLAVA, Feb 10 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Slovak\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  crown\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par was trading calmly on Thursday morning with dealers saying that\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the crown had \par \par \uc2  ushered in stability. \par \par \uc2      The crown was quoted at 42.30/32 to the euro at 0840 GMT, \par \par \uc2  little moved from opening levels. \par \par \uc2      "The market is very calm, since yesterday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  removed some excess foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Juraj Zabadal, a \par \par \uc2  trader at Slovenska Sporitelna. "We are not expecting any major \par \par \uc2  moves and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely to have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  again today," he added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBS) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday to prevent the crown from firming \par \par \uc2  over 42.3 to the euro. The bank has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  around \par \par \uc2  these levels since mid-December. \par \par \uc2  Frantisek Szulenyi, the head of the NBS's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  assets department, said on Wednesday he saw no need to change \par \par \uc2  the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels at the moment. \par \par \uc2  The crown was quoted at 42.57/61 to the dollar at 0840 GMT. \par \par \uc2  ((Andrej Salner, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax \par \par \uc2  421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw2a08ib2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
