\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  c.bank confirms  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  to cap crown. \b0\par\par\uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Februar 2000\par 14:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Feb 9 (Reuters) - The head of the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets department Frantisek Szulenyi said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the crown from firming over 42.3 to the euro on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day local dealers reported they had seen \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  activity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. "I can confirm we have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around 42.30 (to the euro)," Szulenyi told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Szulenyi said the bank (NBS) had placed bids in the market over electronic broker systems, as well as actively paid offers, to bring the midpoint of the level where the crown was quoted above the 42.3 to the euro \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level. \par \par \uc2  The NBS has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at this level repeatedly since mid-December to prevent a firming. \par \par \uc2  "At the moment the situation is unchanged, it depends on macroeconomic indicators, mainly the trade balance and the balance of payments," Szulenyi said. "I see no reason at the moment to change it (the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level)." \par \par \uc2  The bank has said its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level could change at any time if economic fundamentals change. ((Andrej Salner, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax 421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw2908jf6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
