\par\par \b \uc2  CORRECTED-Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Central Europe well supported. \b0\par\par\uc2 695 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Februar 2000\par 11:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  In LONDON story headlined "Emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2 -Central Europe well \par \par \uc2  supported"," please read in seventh paragraph...The crown was \par \par \uc2  trading at 35.798 bid to the euro...instead of...The crown was \par \par \uc2  trading at 25.798 bid to the euro (corrects rate). \par \par \uc2  A corrected repitition follows. \par \par \uc2  LONDON, Feb 4 (Reuters) - Central European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were \par \par \uc2  well supported on Friday, although trade thinned after a hectic \par \par \uc2  week which saw \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the \par \par \uc2  sale of a leading Czech bank as well as busy trade in the zloty. \par \par \uc2  The zloty continued its comeback on Friday, trading at 2.7 \par \par \uc2  percent above parity against its basket of euros and dollars. \par \par \uc2  "I think the zloty will hold around two percent above parity, \par \par \uc2  any lower than that and you see demand from the carry trade as \par \par \uc2  people seek to lock in yields," said one trader. \par \par \uc2  There was a large amount of activity on Thursday, with a \par \par \uc2  corporate order for $100 million and foreigners also sold \par \par \uc2  foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to participate in the T-bill auction. \par \par \uc2  By 1019 GMT, the zloty was trading at 4.1305 bid to the euro \par \par \uc2  compared with 4.1160 at Thursday's European close. \par \par \uc2  Traders said there had been some disappointment in the market \par \par \uc2  that the more than $500 million to be paid by Austria's Erste \par \par \uc2  Bank for Czech Ceska Sporitelna would not go through the market, \par \par \uc2  but would instead be put in a special hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  account. \par \par \uc2  The crown was trading at 35.798 bid to the euro, slightly \par \par \uc2  weaker than Thursday's close of 35.79. \par \par \uc2  "The market was a little disappointed, but from the \par \par \uc2  authorities' point of view it is quite sensible," said the \par \par \uc2  trader. \par \par \uc2  The Czech crown has been steadily appreciating on the back of \par \par \uc2  strong privatisation revenues. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the Slovak crown was little changed and there was \par \par \uc2  no sign of renewed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  after two \par \par \uc2  bouts to stop the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firming. \par \par \uc2  The Slovak crown was at 42.260 bid, slightly weaker than \par \par \uc2  yesterday's 42.24 \par \par \uc2  ** Following is a table of key emerging market exchange rates, \par \par \uc2  including the change versus late New York trade the previous day \par \par \uc2  and the change in the year to date. \par \par \uc2  ** The Czech, Polish, Hungarian and Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , formerly \par \par \uc2  quoted against the mark, are now quoted against the euro to \par \par \uc2  reflect new market norms. All other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are quoted \par \par \uc2  against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  ** According to market convention, exchange rates are quoted in \par \par \uc2  units per dollar or euro and the percentage change denotes the \par \par \uc2  rise or fall of the dollar or euro value. \par \par \uc2  ** Annual percentage changes are calculated from late on the \par \par \uc2  first day of the current trading year, January 3. \par \par \b \