, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax \par \par \uc2  421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw1s07ofy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
