\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak crown calm, tight range seen due to c.bank. \b0\par\par\uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Januar 2000\par 09:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BRATISLAVA, Jan 17 (Reuters) - The Slovak crown\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par was unmoved early on Monday and dealers expected the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  stick to last week's narrow trading band limited by the threat \par \par \uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the up side. \par \par \uc2      The crown was quoted at 42.27/33 to the euro at 0810 GMT, \par \par \uc2  unchanged from opening levels. \par \par \uc2      "There is still pressure for a firming," said Juraj Zabadal, \par \par \uc2  a trader at Slovenska Sporitelna. "But we will probably stick to \par \par \uc2  last week's band of 42.300 to 42.330, due to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," \par \par \uc2  he added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been repeatedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  since mid-December to prevent the crown from firming over 42.300 \par \par \uc2  to the euro, saying a rapid firming may hurt trade performance. \par \par \uc2  Last week the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on four consecutive days. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the upward pressure came mainly from \par \par \uc2  non-resident players interested in Slovak government bonds, \par \par \uc2  domestic corporate orders and general expectations of higher \par \par \uc2  foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows due to privatisations planned for 2000. \par \par \uc2  The crown was quoted at 41.83/90 to the dollar at 0810 GMT. \par \par \uc2  ((Andrej Salner, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax \par \par \uc2  421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw1h00zo9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
