\par\par \b \uc2  INTERVIEW -  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank can afford more  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Robin Shepherd \par \uc2 786 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 2000\par 16:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Jan 13 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Marian Jusko said on Thursday he had been surprised that the bank had needed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the crown so often this year but added it could afford more \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  against any excessive firming. \par \par \uc2  "The amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past 13 days of this year quite surpised me. We did not expect such a sharp start but it is all still in accordance and within the framework set out by the monetary programme," he told Reuters in an interview. \par \par \uc2  Deputy Premier for the Economy Ivan Miklos said on Wednesday that \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  were justified at present but that in the longer term the finances of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be taken into account. \par \par \uc2  The bank has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times since mid-December to prevent the crown, which was floated in October 1998, from firming through 42.3 to the euro. Dealers said they had seen another \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, the fourth session in a row. \par \par \uc2  While the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also often said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  should reflect fundamentals, the governor pointed out that the rate of the crown could itself influence those fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  "Excessive strengthening of the crown could threaten our aims to further improve macroeconomic results, mainly in foreign trade," he said. \par \par \uc2  Asked how long the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could afford to continue \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jusko said: \par \par \uc2  "Monetary policy is not determined by the financial results of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I think the bank has enough reserves to incur certain expenses to maintain a monetary situation corresponding with the state and development needs of our economy." \par \par \uc2  Analysts expect that major privatisations in 2000 will attract a big inflow of funds, further complicating \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  efforts to keep the crown from rising. Jusko said the bank was ready to sterilise such inflows. \par \par \uc2  "There will be costs and they are significant but the bank has large assets so we can bear these costs." \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to give any figures as to its current level of reserves or how much it has spent so far during its market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Jusko acknowledged that he was not running a purely free floating exchange rate regime for the crown. \par \par \uc2  "Of course it could be argued that there is not a clean float here - I also think there isn't - and that there is here some form of managed float," he said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have repeatedly stressed that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not designed to counter trends. Jusko, however, pushed a softer line. "If someone thinks that our policy is a managed float or that we are \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on trends or the amount of fluctuation, I'll be glad to listen to these discussions but I think that what really matters for the economy is (\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) transparency." \par \par \uc2  Turning to wider aspects of monetary policy, Jusko said interest rates lower than headline inflation could be satisfactory if inflation was being driven by adminstrative measures such as price deregulations. \par \par \uc2  "We could say that in the second half of (last) year the interest rate level was too low compared to inflation at that time. Since we know (the cause was) a one time measure whose effect will pass, that these were administrative measures, I think it is necessary to express satisfaction with the current level of interest rates." \par \par \uc2  Statistical office figures released on Wednesday put inflation in December at 14.2 percent year-on-year. One year interest rates were quoted on the interbank market on Thursday at 10.30/11.00 percent. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has targeted core inflation at 4.5 to 5.8 percent for end-December 2000 but many analysts say \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  warnings of a credit crunch this year suggest that monetary policy may not be adjusted to achieving this aim at all costs. \par \par \uc2  When this point was put to Jusko he said: \par \par \uc2  "On the one hand monetary policy cannot be too inward looking, exclusively following monetary aims regardless of the real state of the economy...We don't want to achieve the best possible monetary results at the expense of development opportunities for the real economy." "On the other hand monetary policy should not be too relaxed...We want to avoid the mistakes of conditions being such that access to credit is too easy and there is a great possibility in our situation that credits would be given that wouldn't be repaid." \par \par \uc2  He concluded the interview by saying that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had no major differences with the finance minstry and that communication between the two was good. ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax, 421-7-5341-8403 bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw1d00y1n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
