\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank again  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  as crown firms. \b0\par\par\uc2 192 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Januar 2000\par 09:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Jan 11 (Reuters) - Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday morning, buying euros at around 42.29 to the crown. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is buying euros again and they are still there. It was at about 0855 (0755 GMT) and at about 42.29 to the euro," said one local dealer. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBS) was not immediately available to confirm the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The bank has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the crown from firming at or around the 42.300 to the euro level several times in December, and again on January 3 and January 10. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary programme calls for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent excess volatility, but not to counter trends. NBS Monetary Department Director Elena Kohutikova said last week the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as pressures for a crown firming were one offs. \par \par \uc2  Kohutikova said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level may easily change at any time, depending on the development of economic fundamentals. ((Robin Shepherd, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax 421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw1b03nq9\par }\page {\par