\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak crown steady, mkt eyes cbank, non-residents. \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 2000\par 09:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BRATISLAVA, Jan 4 (Reuters) - The Slovak crown\tab \tab  was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par quiet early on Tuesday with local dealers saying London banks'\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  interest in buying crowns may test the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolve to \par \par \uc2  cap the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength. \par \par \uc2      At 0810 GMT the crown was quoted unmoved at 42.25/35 to the \par \par \uc2  euro. \par \par \uc2      "So far, there hasn't been much trading today," said Boris \par \par \uc2  Somorovsky, a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Tatrabanka. "The crown could trade \par \par \uc2  in a range between 42.150 and 42.400 to the euro, but that \par \par \uc2  depends on whether the NBS will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again and on the \par \par \uc2  behaviour of London banks," he added. \par \par \uc2  The crown firmed slightly on Monday under pressure from \par \par \uc2  foreign banks, prompting \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBS) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap \par \par \uc2  its strength at around 42.300 to the euro. \par \par \uc2      But London-based banks, closed for a holiday, did not trade \par \par \uc2  on Monday. \par \par \uc2      "The question is whether London players will join the trend \par \par \uc2  and start buying \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crowns as well," said Somorovsky. \par \par \uc2      Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came at levels around 42.29 to the \par \par \uc2  euro. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official monetary programme calls for \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  against excess volatility but not against trends. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Marian Jusko said late last year the \par \par \uc2  bank would aim to keep the crown at around prevailing levels - \par \par \uc2  then 42.3 to the euro - in 2000, but acknowledged there would \par \par \uc2  probably be pressure for appreciation. \par \par \uc2  The crown was quoted at 41.16/26 to the dollar at 0810 GMT. \par \par \uc2  ((Andrej Salner, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax \par \par \uc2  421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dw1401hj0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
