\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS -  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  seen light. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Peter Javurek \par \uc2 393 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Dezember 1999\par 17:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Dec 21 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and dealers said the bank had capped crown gains at 42.300 to the euro. \par \par \uc2  Dealers here said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was light and made sense after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday and Wednesday last week when NBS governor Marian Jusko said it was to prevent the crown from strengthing above 42.300 to the euro. \par \par \uc2  Only two dealers said they had seen the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  act on Tuesday while others said any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  must have been in very small volume. \par \par \uc2  The dealers that saw \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from around 42.27 to the 42.3 level. \par \par \uc2  "It all happened pretty quietly...The NBS hung its bid on the trading system and only when some bank applied to it, it became clear it had been the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Marek Senkovic, a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Istrobanka told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "My estimate is that it (volume) could be only 3-4 million euros...Certainly not 10 (million) or more," Senkovic said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to give the actual amount involved in its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Xenia Eacups from Tatra Banka said she had seen the crown peak at 42.260/300 to the euro earlier on Tuesday and this was probably the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had stepped in. \par \par \uc2  "In my view...the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came at the moment when the midpoint of the crown rate-spread was lower than 42.300 (to the euro)," Eacups said. "We can say it was only symbolic \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...slightly stronger than just a verbal one," she said. \par \par \uc2  Referring to governor Jusko's remarks last week about the 42.3 level, Senkovic said: \par \par \uc2  "I think this is exactly what we saw today. I don't think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would come up with a bid of some 42.400 or so, as it has been only checking the 42.300 level in recent days." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  department head Karol Mrva also said last week that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be used to check volatility. He said the bank now understood volatility to mean a "significant strengthening" of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax 421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvcl07t1p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
