\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  c.bank confirms crown  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 207 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Dezember 1999\par 14:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Dec 21 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  told Reuters on Tuesday that it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market earlier in the day to weaken the crown against the euro. \par \par \uc2  Two dealers had said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been present but others said they had only heard rumours and that any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  must have been on very small volumes. \par \par \uc2  "The National Bank of Slovakia was present on the market," spokesman Jan Onda said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The dealers that saw \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  up from around 42.27 to the 42.3 per euro level. Last week the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday and Wednesday when the crown strengthened over 42.3 to the euro. \par \par \uc2  Last week, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Marian Jusko told journalists that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would prevent the crown from strengthing over 42.3 to the euro. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  department head Karol Mrva also said last week that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be used to check volatility. He said the bank now understood volatility to mean a "significant strengthening" of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax, 421-7-5341-8403 bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvcl07snl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
