\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 , bidding at 42.3 to euro. \b0\par\par\uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 1999\par 11:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Dec 15 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday to weaken the crown, bidding at 42.3 to the euro, dealers told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "They are bidding at 42.300 to the euro. It seems foreign banks are trying to test the NBS resolve," a dealer, who requested anonymity, told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said just prior to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that rumours it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier in the morning were untrue. It added, however, that it remained prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  should the need arise. \par \par \uc2  The head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  department Karol Mrva said the bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  against volatility. \par \par \uc2  He said volatility was now understood to mean a significant strengthening of the crown. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the bank bid down the crown to 42.15 to the euro and in mid-afternoon to 42.3 after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in early trade hit its strongest level since the creation of the euro, at 42.087 according to Reuters data. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to dampen down the crown, whose gains it attributed to Slovakia's invitation to begin membership talks with the European Union and end of year position closing. \par \par \uc2  ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax, 421-7-5341-8403 bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvcf086fd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
