\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS -  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank resumes  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Andrej Salner \par \uc2 387 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 1999\par 16:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Dec 15 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it had again \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap crown strength, with dealers seeing \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the bid at 42.300 to the euro for most of the day. \par \par \uc2  The bank said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been on a much smaller scale than Tuesday but \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman Ivan Paska told Reuters "When it will be necessary the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again." \par \par \uc2  Market players estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the tune of around 30 million euros on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers reported that the bank had first entered the market on Wednesday when the crown touched 42.27 to the euro in mid-morning and bid it back to 42.3. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been trading above 42.3 throughout the afternoon and at 1517 GMT was quoted at 42.28/36 to the euro. The crown had opened at 42.32/40. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  move maintained stability in the crown market. \par \par \uc2  "The whole day has been relatively quiet thanks to a stable bid at 42.300 which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems to have owned up to," said Mario Mika, a trader at VUB Bank. "Their \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was a success because it did prevent extreme volatility." \par \par \uc2  Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  activity followed several rounds of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday to dampen down the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said had picked up strength because of Slovakia's invitation to join European Union accession talks on Friday and end of year position closing. \par \par \uc2  Prior to the crown's strengthening in the early part of this week, 42.300 had represented the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's year high and dealers said this appeared to be the strongest level the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was prepared to accept. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a target range for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but keeps it a closely guarded secret. \par \par \uc2  Before Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  department, Karol Mrva, said the bank remained prepared to move if the crown firmed sharply. \par \par \uc2  He added that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be used to check volatility. "These days, of course, volatility is viewed as a significant strengthening." ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax, 421-7-5341-8403 bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvcf0839c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
