\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank says ready to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  if needed. \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 1999\par 15:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Dec 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman Ivan Paska on Wednesday confirmed that the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the crown and that it remained prepared to do so again should the need arise. \par \par \uc2  "I can say that it (the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) was at a much smaller volume than yesterday," Paska told Reuters. Dealers estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  used around 30 million euros in its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers reported that the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the crown touched 42.27 to the euro earlier on Wednesday and bid it back to 42.3. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been trading above 42.3 throughout the afternoon and at 1441 GMT was quoted at 42.306/386 to the euro. \par \par \uc2  "We did not want the exchange rate to fluctuate too much... We are also concerned with longer term volatility," Paska said. \par \par \uc2  "When it will be necessary the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again." \par \par \uc2  Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  followed several rounds of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday to dampen down the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said had picked up strength because of Slovakia's invitation to join European Union accession talks on Friday, and end of year position closing. \par \par \uc2  ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax, 421-7-5341-8403 bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvcf07zq1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
