\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Dealers mixed on Slovak crown prospects. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Robin Shepherd \par \uc2 490 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Dezember 1999\par 18:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Dec 14 (Reuters) - Dealers and analysts said that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crown had been successful on Tuesday but were unsure whether or for how long the bank could continue to hold the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down. \par \par \uc2  The bank bid down the crown to 42.15 to the euro and in mid afternoon to 42.3 after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in early trade hit its strongest level since the creation of the euro, at 42.087 according to Reuters data. \par \par \uc2  "If we compare the morning levels with those now, we can only say that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was successful today," said Boris Somorovsky, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Tatra Banka. \par \par \uc2  But, he added, it was difficult to predict what would happen next. At the end of the day's trading the crown was quoted at 42.322/402. \par \par \uc2  "If client orders to buy crowns and sell \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dominate on the market, pressing the crown back down to the 42.000 level, I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again...But there are too many 'ifs' in this." \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to dampen down the crown whose gains it attributed to Slovakia's invitation to begin membership talks with the European Union and end of year position closing. \par \par \uc2  But analysts said there were also other factors at play which may be more difficult to counter. \par \par \uc2  "I'm not sure how great a success they're going to have given the euro's broad-based weakness," said Jake Moore, emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Barclay's Capital. "It (the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will only be of limited impact." \par \par \uc2  Stefan Kolek of Hypovereinsbank said the crown would face upward pressure into next year as well, particularly because of inflows generated by the government's ambitious privatisation programme. \par \par \uc2  "In the next year there is a huge programme of privatisation which would push the crown stronger...We expect a soft landing next year in the economy supported basically by exports and a stronger crown would undermine seriously the business cycle." \par \par \uc2  "So they will have to do something and some kind of sterilisation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows next year will come in my view," he added. \par \par \uc2  Slovak Deputy Prime Minister for the Economy Ivan Miklos said that Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the crown was good news for the country's current account deficit prospects. \par \par \uc2  He added that a rate of around 43 to the euro was "balanced from the perspective of positives and negatives". \par \par \uc2  Slovakia's reformist government came to power late last year, pledging to slash current account and budget deficits. Analsyst say it has made considerable progress although austerity measures have led to a slump in economic growth. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they thought that around 30 million euros may have been used in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  itself has declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvce0840h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
