\par\par \b \uc2  CORRECTED -  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  FinMin says prefers no crown  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  in '99. \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Dezember 1999\par 14:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  In Bratislava story "\b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  FinMin says prefers no crown \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 " please read \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  quote in fourth paragraph as against the dollar, not euro. \par \par \uc2  A corrected version follows \par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Dec 13 (Reuters) - Slovak Finance Minister Brigita Schmognerova said on Thursday that she would prefer the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets before the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  "I wouldn't like to interfere in the exchange rate policy of the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS). I think the NBS is considering very carefully whether, when and how to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I would just like to say that I would be glad if these measures did not come before the end of the year," she told a news conference. \par \par \uc2  Schmognerova's comments come at a time when the crown has been touching year highs. It strengthened further on Friday after the European Union formally invited Slovakia to begin membership talks. \par \par \uc2  At 1339 GMT on Monday the crown was quoted at 41.755/874 to the dollar (correct). \par \par \uc2  Schmognerova said that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could make it more difficult for companies doing their final accounting at the end of the year because it would make calculation of exchange rate risk more difficult. \par \par \uc2  This, she said, was the reason for her preference against \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at this time. She did not elaborate. \par \par \uc2  ((Andrej Salner, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax 421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com) \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvcd0878w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
