\par\par \b \uc2  National Bk Of Slovakia To Hold Briefing At 1300 GMT \b0\par\par\uc2 101 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Mai 1999\par 14:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  PRAGUE (Dow Jones)--Representatives from the National Bank of Slovakia will hold a press conference at 1300 GMT to discuss the current situation on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, according to a statement from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  As reported, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly this week to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  koruna which has sagged to record lows against the dollar and euro due in part to concerns about the pace of economic reform and upcoming presidential elections on May 29. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 20-05-99 \par \par \uc2  1207GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv5k03uiz\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Slovak near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\b